{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14817","headline":"詶陈翃郎中冬至携柳郎窦郎归河中旧居见寄 · 卢纶","name":"詶陈翃郎中冬至携柳郎窦郎归河中旧居见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三旬一休沐，清景满林庐。\n南郭羣儒从，东牀两客居。\n烧烟浮雪野，麦陇润冰渠。\n班白皆持酒，蓬茅尽有书。\n终期买寒渚，同此利蒲鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}